<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Privacy Policy — Hold Off</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #f8fafc;
      --surface: #ffffff;
      --text: #0f172a;
      --muted: #475569;
      --line: #dbe4ee;
      --accent: #6366f1;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.65;
    }

    .shell {
      max-width: 860px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 20px 36px;
    }

    header {
      padding: 22px 0;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .brand {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: var(--text);
    }

    nav a {
      text-decoration: none;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-left: 14px;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 4vw, 2.6rem);
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    }

    .meta {
      margin-top: 8px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.92rem;
    }

    section {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 18px;
      margin-top: 14px;
    }

    h2 {
      margin: 0 0 8px;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
    }

    p, li { color: #334155; }
    ul { margin: 8px 0 0 20px; padding: 0; }

    a { color: var(--accent); }

    footer {
      margin-top: 24px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      padding-top: 16px;
      text-align: center;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    @media (max-width: 700px) {
      header { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; }
      nav a { margin: 0 12px 0 0; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="shell">
    <header>
      <a href="/" class="brand">Hold Off</a>
      <nav>
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <a href="/terms">Terms</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="meta">Effective date: July 11, 2026</p>

      <section>
        <h2>What we collect</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Account details like email and login data.</li>
          <li>Message and usage data needed to run Hold Off features.</li>
          <li>Subscription records processed by Stripe.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>How we use information</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Provide and improve Hold Off.</li>
          <li>Deliver account, billing, and support communications.</li>
          <li>Protect the service from abuse and security risks.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>How we share information</h2>
        <p>We do not sell your personal information. We only share data with trusted providers that power core service functions (for example hosting, AI processing, and payments), or when required by law.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Your choices</h2>
        <p>You can request access, correction, or deletion of your account data by emailing <a href="mailto:privacy@shouldiholdoff.live">privacy@shouldiholdoff.live</a>.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>If you have privacy questions, contact us at <a href="mailto:privacy@shouldiholdoff.live">privacy@shouldiholdoff.live</a>.</p>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <a href="/privacy">Privacy</a> · <a href="/terms">Terms</a>
    </footer>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
